Subject: [PATCH] feat(21-23): implement conditional supervision handoff

Validate the non-official disposable-profile bootstrap and deliver two exact-bound one-shot pairing codes behind the optional dispatcher.

Apply bounded parsing, constant-time challenge checks, attempt and expiry caps, and secure terminal cleanup.
